[id:2685583481]
[ti:Radio (Dum-Dum)]
[ar:宋雨琦]
[al:Radio (Dum-Dum)]
[by:维尔日记]
[00:10.00]作词 : 宋雨琦/Taneisha Jackson
[00:10.59]作曲 : 宋雨琦/Siixk Jun/Taneisha Jackson/Cheatkey
[00:11.19]编曲 : Siixk Jun/Cheatkey
[00:11.79]Hello I'm not sorry that I had to let you go / 你好呀 我并不后悔与你分开
[00:16.41]There's somethings that you should really know listen / 有些建议你真的应该认真听清楚来
[00:20.61]I used to date a rockboy and he stole my heart / 之前我和个摇滚男孩约会 他偷走我的心
[00:26.01]Had me rolling in the deep so bad / 让我内心苦苦挣扎 无法自拔
[00:28.04]Anywhere he go you know I'd go / 你知道 只有他在的地方 我也会去
[00:31.77]Promised me forever seven days of the week / 他曾许诺我一周七天 永远都不会离我而去
[00:34.44]But he was too busy getting down in the sheets / 但他总是忙着沾花惹草
[00:37.07]I used to date a rockboy till he broke my heart / 之前我和个摇滚男孩约会 他伤碎了我的心
[00:43.34]He tried so hard to win me back over / 他煞费苦心 想要和我复合
[00:47.40]With a couple melodies / 给我唱了几首歌
[00:50.14]Had to let him know that he can't play me / 我得让他认清事实 他就不该玩弄我的心
[00:53.47]Oh there's this boy that I know / Oh 我对这个男孩了如指掌
[00:56.16]He made my heart beat like radio / 他让我内心怦怦直跳 犹如收音机
[00:58.85]It used to go dum-dum dadadada-dum / 那节奏曾是多么动听
[01:01.75]Dadadada-dum dadada-dum / 多么动听
[01:04.25]But now I'm fine so when his songs are playing loud on the radio / 但是现在我已经放下 所以当电台播放他的音乐时
[01:09.78]I'm over that dum-dum dadadada-dum / 现在听到那节奏 我无动于衷
[01:12.60]Dadadada-dum dadada-dum / 现在听到那节奏
[01:19.95]Oh yeah my momma taught me / Oh 没错 妈妈曾告诫我
[01:22.17]Never let nobody treat me any less than I deserve / 绝对不要让任何人亏待我
[01:25.07]I'm not a dummy / 我才没那么傻呢
[01:26.34]Trust me / 相信我
[01:27.06]He's the one that's begging now / 他现在肯定在苦苦哀求我
[01:28.35]Miss me 'cause I'm not around / 我不在他身边 他是多么思念我
[01:29.71]Guess you only know just what you / 看来只有心爱的人离开 你才会意识到
[01:31.16]Got when it walks out and you best believe / 自己曾拥有过 你可得明白
[01:35.16]I'd never give my heart again to somebody / 我绝不会再把我的真心交给
[01:37.53]Like a rockboy 'cause he broke my heart / 伤透我心的一个摇滚男孩
[01:43.40]He tried so hard to win me back over / 他煞费苦心 想要和我复合
[01:47.42]With a couple melodies / 给我唱了几首歌
[01:50.09]Had to let him know that he can't play me / 我得让他认清事实 他就不该玩弄我的心
